1
00:00:00,234 --> 00:00:03,914
I'm... I'm gonna need a Band-Aid.

2
00:00:08,141 --> 00:00:11,451
$0... what did you think
of your first funeral?

3
00:00:11,612 --> 00:00:14,222
(Penny:)Well, I don't want to be a jerk,
but it was kind of a bummer.

4
00:00:16,049 --> 00:00:19,459
(Leonard:)Yeah, well, when I die,
you can rent a bounce house.

5
00:00:20,954 --> 00:00:22,494
(Penny:)You think about dying?

6
00:00:22,656 --> 00:00:25,656
(Leonard:)Well, I think more about
if I'd have any regrets.

7
00:00:25,826 --> 00:00:26,996
(Penny:)What would you regret?

8
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:30,160
(Sheldon:)You know,
that I didn't travel more,

9
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:32,830
(Leonard:)take more risks,
learn another language.

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,480
(Penny:)You know Klingon.

11
00:00:36,503 --> 00:00:39,243
(Leonard:)-That's true.
-No, I meant that as a regret.

12
00:00:44,344 --> 00:00:45,484
(Leonard:)I just thought of one more.

13
00:00:45,646 --> 00:00:47,096
(Penny:)What's that?

14
00:00:47,247 --> 00:00:50,817
I regret not saying "yes"
when you asked me to marry you.

15
00:00:51,852 --> 00:00:54,022
(Penny:)Well, it just wasn't the right time.

